e middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle went from 201% of normal in June to July to 19% in November to December. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 19% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 2012, with grid 25624 lowest at 49%.</p>"}
